{"about_the_game":"Are you tired of looking through casual games to spend your time? Of trying one game after another?<br />\r\nGame Tube can solve this problem of choice! Now you don't need to look for casual mini games - they will come to you when you open Game Tube! <br />\r\nHere you can access a variety of mini games. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll the mini games have one system of points. Playing one of the mini games you receive points to unlock other even cooler mini games.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow you can already become an expert in these mini games:<br />\r\n\u265b Arrow shooting: Become a cool archer and hit the target!<br />\r\n\u265b 2D space shooter: Shoot all the enemies and show invaders who's the boss here!<br />\r\n\u265b Endless runner: Run as long as you can but don't forget about the obstacles! <br />\r\n\u265b Clicker: Click what? you may ask. Have a try and check how quick you are!  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRemember: the list of games will grow and new ones will become available. We'll try to make you happy adding different interesting games and new ideas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLeaderboards and Achievements are available for each mini game.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Run Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/763300/dc2f3fa4aa13d4483775a7e654ebc6788298a9f4.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/763300/35beaff0b492d9486123ba4fb36af4ca74cc614a.jpg"},{"name":"47","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/763300/b2571a31911bfdd5a5707da69e805b5dd606c48c.jpg"},{"name":"44","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/763300/518cfd7f42a58e559c540a84939f2b381919c685.jpg"},{"name":"48","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/763300/609325a5cfc0a310f5a696dc65d15752aa96cab1.jpg"},{"name":"50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/